{"id":"cozinheiro","lemma":"cozinheiro","pos":"noun","rank":3271,"glosses":["cook (a person who prepares food for a living)"],"ipa":"/ku.ziˈɲɐj.ɾu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cozinheiros","feminine":"cozinheira","femininePlural":"cozinheiras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-cozinheiro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom é um mau cozinheiro.","en":"Tom is a bad cook.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/493608","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad"},null]},{"text":"Ela parece ser uma boa cozinheira.","en":"She seems to be a good cook.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"an interesting story"},null]},{"text":"Serei o cozinheiro à noite.","en":"I will be the cook tonight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58392","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"at night"]]},{"text":"Eu vi a cozinheira.","en":"I saw the cook.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1269652","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"ver"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Onde está o cozinheiro?","en":"Where's the cook?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}